            "review_text": "Phan H\n3 contributions\n0\nOne of the best brunch spots I’ve ever tried!\nJan 2025 • Family\nI absolutely love the food here! Every dish is crafted with care and attention to detail. The Shashuka and the toasts and drinks are incredibly delicious—honestly even better than some of the brunch spots I’ve tried in the U.S. The flavors are rich, well-balanced, and truly memorable. On top of that, the cozy atmosphere makes it a perfect place to relax and enjoy a great meal. I’ll definitely be coming back!\nWritten January 24, 2025",
