            "review_text": "Cece\n3 contributions\n0\nBrunch lovers\nJan 2025 • Friends\nI had an amazing brunch experience at this charming café in Da Nang! The Western-style menu is simply delightful, with highlights like the Royale Benedict – perfectly cooked eggs and rich, flavorful hollandaise sauce that melt in your mouth. Their latte is also a must-try – smooth, creamy, and brewed to perfection. The cozy ambiance and attentive staff make it the perfect spot to relax and enjoy great food. Highly recommend this place for brunch lovers!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 21, 2025",
