            "review_title": "Review at Byc. Cafe And Brunch",
            "review_text": "DAT\nVietnam3 contributions\n0\nBrunch o’clock at byC – where every bite feels like a warm hug\nDec 2024 • Friends\nIf you're looking for the perfect spot to enjoy brunch in Da Nang, byC is a must-visit. The restaurant impresses not only with its cozy atmosphere and elegant decor but also with its diverse and creative menu.\n\nEvery dish here is meticulously prepared, striking a perfect balance between traditional and modern flavors. From soft, fragrant pancakes to protein-rich options like eggs Benedict or avocado toast, each bite promises a delightful culinary experience. The drinks, including smoothies, espresso-based coffee, and herbal teas, are not only delicious but also highly nutritious.\n\nThe staff is attentive and dedicated, ensuring you feel completely at ease throughout your visit. This is truly an ideal destination for a relaxing weekend, catching up with friends, or simply savoring sweet moments over a delicious meal.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 4, 2024",
